From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:37:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 37/38] freedreno/a2xx: import shared buffers with a2xx's pitch
 alignment

fd_layout_resource_for_handle() aligned the pitch to gmem_align_w (128
pixels on a2xx), but a2xx lays resources out with 32-pixel alignment, so
it rejected buffers it had exported itself: X's DRI3 failed every
xcb_dri3_pixmap_from_buffer and EGL clients under X had no back buffer.
On Xenos a shared buffer is also tiled, the only layout it renders.
With -Dplatforms=x11, glmark2-es2 now renders in an X window.

